"id":"v8","en":"we / us","note":"","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"們","py":"men","t":5,"s":"们"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv8.mp3","label":"我們 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v9","en":"all","note":"","cells":[{"ch":"都","py":"dōu","t":1,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"°","col":"#E67700","lab":"d","cue":"no puff, no voice: sPin","kind":"nopuff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv9.mp3","label":"都 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v10","en":"today","note":"jīn = Position 1 j, tip down","cells":[{"ch":"今","py":"jīn","t":1,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"天","py":"tiān","t":1,"mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"1","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"j","cue":"Position 1: tip behind bottom teeth","kind":"p1"},{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"t","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv10.mp3","label":"今天 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v11","en":"everybody","note":"","cells":[{"ch":"大","py":"dà","t":4},{"ch":"家","py":"jiā","t":1}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv11.mp3","label":"大家 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]}]},{"type":"cards","title":"Listening notes","items":[["3+3 chains: 我也有一點累.","我也有 is three zombies in a row. The score draws one common reading (wǒ yé yǒu yì diǎn lèi, by rule); speakers also say wó yé yǒu… depending on how they group the words. Listen for which syllables rise, and copy the audio, not the rule."],["Half-thirds everywhere.","我還好, 怎麼了, 我們, 好像: a 3rd before a non-3rd stays low 21 with no rise. Only phrase-final 好 in 我還好 can show a full 214."],["啊 linking.","啊 a is neutral and borrows its onset from the syllable before it: after duì and nǐ (ending in [i]) you may hear ya. Its pitch hangs off the preceding tone, low after the 4th in 對啊."],["Neutral tone after a 4th vs a 3rd.","累了 lèi le: le sits low (~1) after the falling 4th. Compare me in 怎麼 after a low 3rd, where it pops up (~4)."]]}],"schema":1,"date":"2026-10-12T08:00-04:00"}